      "id": 222957,
      "name": "Ameena",
      "username": "Ameena",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ameena/{size}/1907_2.png",
      "created_at": "2018-10-11T13:08:46.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Also, if an attack deals two hits of damage (say, Fanatic's base power, which deals two hits of one point of damage to a single target), each of those hits is a separate instance. So something that takes effect \"the next time damage is/would be dealt\" only gets to trigger off the first of those hits.</p>",
      "post_number": 3,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:55:59.999Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
